    "title": "Job Opening Hotel Manager at Sapphire Foods India Ventures Solutions",
    "description": "Grow your career with Sapphire Foods India Ventures Solutions! We are hiring a Hotel Manager for our Bhopal team. Be part of a workplace that celebrates innovation, diversity, and performance.\n\nAbout Sapphire Foods India Ventures Solutions:\nSapphire Foods India Ventures Solutions is a leading organization in the On-site sector, committed to excellence, innovation, and employee growth. We offer a dynamic work environment where talent is recognized and rewarded.\n\nKey Responsibilities:\n• Monitor F&B service quality and maintain hygiene standards\n• Manage reservations and optimize room revenue through yield management\n• Deliver exceptional guest experiences in line with brand standards\n• Manage front office operations including check-in/check-out\n• Prepare daily operating reports and present to management\n• Plan and execute banquets, events, and MICE functions\n• Assist in menu planning, costing, and food festival coordination\n\nRequired Skills & Qualifications:\n• Post Graduate Diploma in relevant field\n• 3-6 years of relevant experience\n• Proficiency in PMS Systems\n• Proficiency in F&B Service\n• Proficiency in Sommelier Skills\n• Proficiency in Food Safety\n• Proficiency in Front Office\n• Proficiency in Tour Planning\n• Proficiency in Revenue Management\n• Proficiency in OTA Management\n\nWork Mode: On-site - Work from our office\n\nWhat We Offer:\n• Competitive salary with performance-linked incentives\n• Comprehensive health insurance for self and family\n• Maternity and paternity leave\n• Modern office with recreational facilities\n• International travel opportunities for senior roles\n• Provident Fund and Gratuity as per company policy\n• Salary Range: 7 LPA - 15 LPA per annum\n\nLocation: Bhopal, Madhya Pradesh, India\n\nIf you are excited about this opportunity, apply now and take the next step in your career journey with Sapphire Foods India Ventures Solutions!",
